# SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite this repository and the methodological references listed in docs/RELATED_WORK.md."
title: "FedBrain: six-site federated learning for brain-network analysis with a recorded data-flow explorer"
abstract: >-
  A six-site federated learning system for brain-network analysis on public ABIDE-I data,
  with a browser interface that shows which health data stay at each site and which tensors
  cross the federation boundary. All reported measurements are produced by this system.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Cybermatics-prog/fedbrain-federated-brain-network"
keywords:
  - federated learning
  - brain connectivity
  - ABIDE
  - autism
  - privacy-preserving
